{"alias":"/safety","title":"Maine School Safety Center Services","changed":"2026-09-15T20:13:10+00:00","before":"<p><img alt=\"Banner\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"060bb2fd-9cf1-4150-b8ae-05a1594ab433\" height=\"100%\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/School%20Safety%20-%20Homepage%20Banner.png\" width=\"100%\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\"><iframe align=\"left\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"315\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ao_6Hn03CLo?si=dMrvz2zzDmazE56z\" style=\"margin-right: 10px;\" title=\"YouTube video player\" width=\"560\"></iframe></div>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; text-align: left;\"><em>This video goes over the amendments to Sec.1. 20-A MRSA §1001, sub-§16 (LD892) that was enacted on October 25, 2023, regarding the Comprehensive Health and Safety and Emergency Management Plan</em>.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Upcoming Events</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><iframe allow=\"fullscreen\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://gateway.maine.gov/doe/communications/calendar/?focus=School+Safety&amp;carousel=1\" style=\"width:100%;min-height:480px;border:0;display:block;\" title=\"Maine DOE Events Calendar\"></iframe></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 class=\"text-align-center\">Our Services</h2>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-align-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\r\n<div class=\"card\"><img alt=\"presenter showing notes\" class=\"card-img-top\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"6d464032-d7e8-4e8c-a5eb-24fe194399e1\" height=\"100%\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/jason-goodman-Oalh2MojUuk-unsplash%20%281%29.jpg\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h5 class=\"card-title\">Training</