/h5>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"card-text\">Please visit the following pages for information about our services, our work with partner organizations, and the CSTAG model.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"http://www.maine.gov/doe/safety/threatassessment\">Our Behavioral Threat Management Services</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"http://www.maine.gov/doe/safety/threatassessmentlinks\">Anonymous Threats, Swatting Calls, and more</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.schoolta.com/\">Dr. Cornell's website on the CSTAG model</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\r\n<div class=\"card\"><img alt=\"students sitting in a circle on the grass\" class=\"card-img-top\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"f1a66ab2-bef8-4522-9cd2-0d03f9fee55c\" height=\"100%\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/beth-macdonald-mbND4xtrlVY-unsplash_1.jpg\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h5 class=\"card-title\">Restorative Practices</h5>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"card-text\">Please visit the following pages for more information.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"http://www.maine.gov/doe/safety/restorative\">Our Restorative Practices Services</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"http://rethinkingschools.org/articles/restorative-justice/\">What are Restorative Practices?</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"http://legislature.maine.gov/legis/statutes/20-A/title20-Asec1001.html\">Maine Statute for Restorative Code of Conduct (section 15)</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\r\n<div class=\"card\"><img alt=\"school bus with stop sign\" class=\"card-img-top\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"9e536ef8-da11-4774-9f31-2fef72ec8336\" height=\"100%\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/robin-jonathan-deutsch-mrGF2txjUYk-unsplash_0.jpg\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h5 class=\"card-title\">Student Transportation Safety</h5>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"card-text\">Please visit the following pages for more information.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"http://www.maine.gov/doe/schools/transportation\">Our Transportation Services</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"http://www.maine.gov/doe/schools/transportation/programs\">Programs &amp; Funding</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"http://www.maine.gov/doe/schools/transportation/data\">Data &amp; Publications</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\" data-entity-type=\"node\" data-entity-uuid=\"0f2f0878-606f-432e-a823-7664fa19f6dd\" href=\"/doe/node/3421\">Maine Clean Bus Programs</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n","after":"<div class=\"doe-hero\">\n<p class=\"doe-lead\"><em>This video goes over the amendments to Sec.1. 20-A MRSA §1001, sub-§16 (LD892) that was enacted on October 25, 2023, regarding the Comprehensive Health and Safety and Emergency Management Plan</em>.</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"blockhead\" id=\"upcoming-events\"><h2>Upcoming Events</h2></div>\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\"><div class=\"doe-video\"><iframe allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ao_6Hn03CLo?si=dMrvz2zzDmazE56z\" title=\"YouTube video player\"></iframe></div></div>\r\n\r\n\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"doe-video\"><iframe allow=\"fullscreen\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://gateway.maine.gov/doe/communications/calendar/?focus=School+Safety&amp;carousel=1\" style=\"min-height:480px;border:0;display:block\" title=\"Maine DOE Events Calendar\"></iframe></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"blockhead\" id=\"our-services\"><h2>Our Services</h2></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\r\n<div class=\"card\"><img alt=\"presenter showing notes\" class=\"card-img-top\" height=\"100%\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/jason-goodman-Oalh2MojUuk-unsplash%20%281%29.jpg\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h3 class=\"card-title\">Training</h3>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"card-text\">Please visit the following pages for more information about our flagship training initiative, safety summit, and other training.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"http://www.maine.gov/doe/safety/initiative\">Maine&nbsp;Safe Schools Initiative</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/safety/schoolsafetyspecialist\">School Safety Specialist Program</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"http://www.maine.gov/doe/safety/training\">Other Training Opportunities</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/node/4063\">Where Have We Trained?</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\r\n<div class=\"card\"><img alt=\"Card image cap\" class=\"card-img-top\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/pexels-scott-webb-430208_0.jpg\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h3 class=\"card-title\">Safety &amp; Security</h3>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"card-text\">Please visit the following pages for resources on physical security, School Resource Officers (SRO), and site assessments.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"http://www.maine.gov/doe/safety/security\">Our Safety &amp; Security Services</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Security Annex</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Site Assessment &amp; Physical Safety</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"http://www.schoolsafety.gov/\">Federal School Safety</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\r\n<div class=\"card\"><img alt=\"Child sitting at desk in classroom\" class=\"card-img-top\" height=\"100%&quot;/\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/taylor-flowe-4nKOEAQaTgA-unsplash%20%281%29.jpg\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h3 class=\"card-title\">School Emergency Management</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Please visit the following pages for more information about our services and resources from our partners.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/safety/emergencymanagement\">Our School Emergency Management Services</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Safety%20-%20Guide%20for%20Developing%20High-Quality%20Emergency%20Operation%20Plans%20-%209.4.2025.pdf\">Guide for High-Quality Emergency Operations Plans</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Safety%20-%20FEMA%20Sample%20Plan%20-%209.8.2025.pdf\">FEMA Sample Plan</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\r\n<div class=\"card\"><img alt=\"person writing in notebook\" class=\"card-img-top\" height=\"100%\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/glenn-carstens-peters-RLw-UC03Gwc-unsplash_1.jpg\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h3 class=\"card-title\">Behavioral Threat Assessment and Management (BTAM)</h3>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"card-text\">Please visit the following pages for information about our services, our work with partner organizations, and the CSTAG model.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"http://www.maine.gov/doe/safety/threatassessment\">Our Behavioral Threat Management Services</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"http://www.maine.gov/doe/safety/threatassessmentlinks\">Anonymous Threats, Swatting Calls, and more</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.schoolta.com/\">Dr. Cornell's website on the CSTAG model</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\r\n<div class=\"card\"><img alt=\"students sitting in a circle on the grass\" class=\"card-img-top\" height=\"100%\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/beth-macdonald-mbND4xtrlVY-unsplash_1.jpg\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h3 class=\"card-title\">Restorative Practices</h3>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"card-text\">Please visit the following pages for more information.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"http://www.maine.gov/doe/safety/restorative\">Our Restorative Practices Services</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"http://rethinkingschools.org/articles/restorative-justice/\">What are Restorative Practices?</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"http://legislature.maine.gov/legis/statutes/20-A/title20-Asec1001.html\">Maine Statute for Restorative Code of Conduct (section 15)</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\r\n<div class=\"card\"><img alt=\"school bus with stop sign\" class=\"card-img-top\" height=\"100%\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/robin-jonathan-deutsch-mrGF2txjUYk-unsplash_0.jpg\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h3 class=\"card-title\">Student Transportation Safety</h3>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"card-text\">Please visit the following pages for more information.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"http://www.maine.gov/doe/schools/transportation\">Our Transportation Services</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"http://www.maine.gov/doe/schools/transportation/programs\">Programs &amp; Funding</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"http://www.maine.gov/doe/schools/transportation/data\">Data &amp; Publications</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/node/3421\">Maine Clean Bus Programs</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\n<p class=\"doe-top\"><a href=\"#top\">Back to top</a></p>","notes":["2 section headers — too few for a contents list."],"decisions":[{"id":"blockhead","on":true,"label":"Turn the headings into section headers","why":"2 headings are plain text where every other page uses a section header, so the page reads as one continuous wall instead of parts.","value":"2 sections"},{"id":"cardtitles","on":true,"label":"Put the card titles on one level","why":"6 card titles are written at a level copied from an example rather than chosen — h5 on a page whose sections are h2. Only the number changes.","value":"6 titles"},{"id":"leftalign","on":true,"label":"Left-align a section header","why":"1 section header is centred, where 1,103 of the 1,139 on the site are left-aligned — the component list says not to centre them. The band runs the full width of the column, so a centred title has no fixed relationship to anything else, and a two-line one breaks the left edge every other heading shares. Only the alignment changes.","value":"1 header"},{"id":"stranded","on":true,"label":"Put the content under its own heading","why":"\"Upcoming Events\" had nothing ben